    <DESCRIPTION>Clusters detected with S/N&gt;4 in the ACTPol E-D56 field (Table 1), redshifts (Table 2) and masses (Table 3)</DESCRIPTION>
<!-- Clusters detected with S/N&gt;4 in the ACTPol E-D56 field (Table 1), redshifts (Table 2) and masses (Table 3) (\originalcolumnnames) -->

